# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Data
# The corpus (10 small documents, ~100 KB) and the vector store (~1.3 MB) are SMALL, so they ARE committed:
# a fresh clone can run the app without rebuilding anything.
# If you replace them with a large corpus, uncomment these lines and explain in the README how to obtain the data:
# data/documents/
# data/vector_store/

# Duplicate copy of the vector store made for the Docker build (the backend also finds data/vector_store on its own)
backend/data/vector_store/*
!backend/data/vector_store/.gitkeep
